{

  "version": "uk_retail_price_bands_v1",

  "currency": "GBP",

  "notes": "Unit-price floors/ceilings for UK single-unit RETAIL shopping comps (Google Shopping). Higher than wholesale bands. Soft flag when within 3× of a bound; hide only beyond 3×. Sources are working assumptions — not list prices.",

